  "description": "*Based on the original short story by novelist Kim Young-Ha, the first page of a tragedy entangled between three men and one woman begins. The webtoon's unique interpretation and writing style fills in the blanks that were not revealed in the original.* \n\nThe first story, The Origin of Life, is Seo-Jin's first love, In-Ah, who appears like a miracle before his eyes. Surprisingly, she is the same as when she was a teenager. New truths are revealed in front of the love between the two people who seemed like they would last forever. \"Seo-Jin, I'm married.\"\n\nThe second story, A Christmas Carol, is the death of 'Cho Jin-Sook', a Korean living in Germany who returned to Korea after 20 years. All three men surrounding her are murder suspects. The more you dig into the charred love between the four men and women, the more it heads toward destruction. What truth will be revealed at the end of these two stories that were reborn as webtoons?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
